# Rust / Cargo
target/
**/target/

# cargo-fuzz generated state (keep harness code, drop runtime data)
**/fuzz/corpus/
**/fuzz/artifacts/
**/fuzz/coverage/

# CMake build output — keep only compile_commands.json (needed by c2rust + stu_selector)
projects/*/build/*
!projects/*/build/compile_commands.json

# Object / binary artifacts
*.o
*.a
*.bin
a.out

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor
*.swp
